sophie: Also add a short note about how Dedicated customers can pin model variants to avoid automatic downgrade — link to runtime routing page (internal).

jamie: One more: update the error-ref mapping so the 429 entry points to this new page and to the SDK retry example. We have a couple of old cross-links that still point to the legacy runbook.

ben: I can take the err-ref change after the PR lands, unless you want me to include it in the same PR.

alex: If you can take it, that'd be great. I'll push the fix and the snippets in the next commit. Thanks all. :tada:
